resource FakeView
  id param:     id
  update:       full replace (PUT), no mask

operations
  create  POST    /fake/views/v1       FakeViewsService_CreateFakeView  body inline  response FakeView (the resource itself)
  get     GET     /fake/views/v1/{id}  FakeViewsService_GetFakeView     body -       response FakeView (the resource itself)
  update  PUT     /fake/views/v1/{id}  FakeViewsService_UpdateFakeView  body inline  response FakeView (the resource itself)
  delete  DELETE  /fake/views/v1/{id}  FakeViewsService_DeleteFakeView  body -       response DeleteFakeViewResponse

fields
  NAME     BEHAVIOR  CREATE             UPDATE             GET  TYPE
  id       computed  -                  -                  yes  string
  name     normal    required           required           yes  string len 1..64
  query    normal    optional presence  optional presence  yes  string
  compact  normal    optional presence  optional presence  yes  bool
  columns  normal    optional presence  optional presence  yes  list<string>
